    "fileId": 26602,
    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\">Comparison of HPV-associated and HPV-independent oropharyngeal squamous cell carcinoma (SCC)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "William Westra",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 652.7pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"870\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Characteristics</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>HPV-associated</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>HPV-independent</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Incidence trend</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Increasing</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Decreasing</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Age</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Younger (~3&ndash;4&nbsp;years)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Older</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Risk factors</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Number of oral sex partners +/&minus; smoking</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Smoking +/&minus; alcohol</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Stage</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Small primary, large nodal metastases</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Variable</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Site of origin</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Crypt epithelium of palatine and lingual tonsils</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Surface epithelium</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Precancerous lesion</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Not recognized</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Squamous dysplasia</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Predominant morphology</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Non-keratinizing SCC</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Keratinizing (conventional) SCC</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Grading </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Not applicable</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Applicable</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>p16 immunostaining</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Almost always positive</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Typically negative</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 147.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"196\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Survival</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.65pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Better overall and progression-free survival</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 252.7pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"337\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Worse overall and progression-free survival</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
